# Placeholders are backend-only

This crate is the global Rainbow API for the **backend** (parse, format, validate, expand, LSP, CLI).

- `#{Name}` holes and `expand_placeholders` / `rainbow expand` stay here.
- iOS and Android parsers consume **concrete** Rainbow after expand. Do not add `RainbowName`, placeholder use/node/value, or expand APIs to those libraries.
- Concrete grammar to mirror on mobile is listed under "shared features" in `docs/PARITY.md`. Backend-only features are listed separately in the same file.
